 🚀 Project Overview

Companies invest money in advertisements across multiple platforms.  
This project analyzes how those investments influence sales and builds a machine learning regression model to predict sales.



 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python 🐍  
- Pandas  
- NumPy  
- Matplotlib  
- Seaborn  
- Scikit-learn  


⚙️ Project Workflow

1. Load the dataset using Pandas  
2. Check for missing values  
3. Select features and target variable  
4. Split data into training and testing sets  
5. Train a **Linear Regression model**  
6. Make predictions on test data  
7. Evaluate the model using performance metrics  
8. Visualize the relationship between advertising spend and sales 
